#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j3-made-official/index.html:0
msgid "A certificate failing verification SHALL produce a Failed result, not an exception or panic. Failed results SHALL name the step that failed and a reason from a closed set shared by both languages: BadPrefix, UnsupportedContextVersion, Base45Invalid, InflateFailed, LimitExceeded, CoseMalformed, HeaderInvalid, UnsupportedAlgorithm, KidNotFound, SignatureInvalid, KeyUsageMismatch, Expired, NotYetValid, HcertMissing, MultipleSubclaims, PayloadInvalid. Exceptions or errors SHALL be reserved for programming errors and infrastructure failures."
msgstr "Un certificat dont la vérification échoue DOIT produire un résultat Failed, et non une exception ou une panique. Les résultats Failed DOIVENT indiquer l’étape qui a échoué et un motif issu d’un ensemble fermé commun aux deux langages : BadPrefix, UnsupportedContextVersion, Base45Invalid, InflateFailed, LimitExceeded, CoseMalformed, HeaderInvalid, UnsupportedAlgorithm, KidNotFound, SignatureInvalid, KeyUsageMismatch, Expired, NotYetValid, HcertMissing, MultipleSubclaims, PayloadInvalid. Les exceptions ou erreurs DOIVENT être réservées aux erreurs de programmation et aux défaillances d’infrastructure."

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-1-full-history-abroad/index.html:0
